==Trivia==
* The music that plays on the boombox during Haru and Tyler's fitness lesson is an arrangement of the "[[Gym|Pokémon Gym]]" [[Pokémon Red & Pokémon Green: Super Music Collection|theme]] from the [[core series games]], originally composed by [[Junichi Masuda]].
===Errors===
* In the {{pmin|the Czech Republic|Czech}} dub, the [[Pokémon Resort]] is incorrectly referred to as a [[Pokémon Center]]. This error is also present in the subsequent episodes.

